{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IT HAS YOUR FACE</strong>. Now it wants your life. Hide, seek, and try to kill your clone in this deceptively simple first-person horror roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/1572260532356d8dde1d3689152e1559.poster.avif?t=1757079152\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/1572260532356d8dde1d3689152e1559.webm?t=1757079152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/1572260532356d8dde1d3689152e1559.mp4?t=1757079152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR CLONE</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your clone is hiding among the crowd, ready to kill you when you\u2019re most vulnerable. Endure procedural paranoia as you search to find your doppelganger before they find you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/f2e03cf8be5aeb51a667a5791e5e5c17.poster.avif?t=1757079152\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/f2e03cf8be5aeb51a667a5791e5e5c17.webm?t=1757079152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/f2e03cf8be5aeb51a667a5791e5e5c17.mp4?t=1757079152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILL YOUR CLONE</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for weapons, manage limited ammo, and prepare carefully to strike. If your assassination fails, you\u2019ll lose the opportunity to stalk from the shadows.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ebbfca69ef3503245f39b30638d20c7a.poster.avif?t=1757079152\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ebbfca69ef3503245f39b30638d20c7a.webm?t=1757079152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ebbfca69ef3503245f39b30638d20c7a.mp4?t=1757079152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIOLOGICAL HORRORS</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll gain a greater understanding of your cursed fate and reveal terrifying new threats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/798128f494bd1ee201881f8d60567214.poster.avif?t=1757079152\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/798128f494bd1ee201881f8d60567214.webm?t=1757079152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/798128f494bd1ee201881f8d60567214.mp4?t=1757079152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BETTER YOU</strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite elements offer upgrades and improvements, giving you greater flexibility to endure increasingly complex challenges.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loo