ics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Behaviour Interactive Inc."],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cIt blends Guess Who with Hitman, and its demo is one of the best I've played in ages. It's an ingenious concept.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cThe demo has provoked in me some of the most pulse-quickening paranoia since the days of DayZ. I remain both intrigued and perturbed by the more overtly horror-flavoured antagonist variants that the final game will feature.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s a simple concept that\u2019s cleverly implemented and gets incredibly nerve-wracking as you make your way through the crowds knowing that one of them is wearing your face. Highly recommended\u201d<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/ss_aeeaadf587f46e602a7894742951053d6ea09dc9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757079152","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/ss_aeeaadf587f46e602a7894742951053d6ea09dc9.600x338.jpg?t=1757079152"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/ss_918c5ca413a645690413c0a727e104c08d7585cc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757079152","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/ss_918c5ca413a645690413c0a727e104c08d7585cc.600x338.jpg?t=1757079152"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item